<title>HONG KONG: Chinese Estates interim net up 35.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Chinese Estates interim net up 35.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   19.4 vs 16.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    11.0 vs 11.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  44.897 gain vs 10.45 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    342.7 vs 253.60</p>
<p>    Turnover		     989.6 vs 566.66</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chinese Estates Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 27 to October 2</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 28</p>
<p>NOTE - Chinese Estates is a property investment firm.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
